'''King of Doom Phono''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[EPICFEST (Gacha Event)|EPICFEST]] gacha event. They were introduced in [[Version 12.3 Update|Version 12.3]].

